{
  "bookId": "hero-215103",
  "id": "bond-28571",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28571001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "团子、团子、团子、团子、团子大家族。\n呀，我，我什么都没说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28571003",
              "text": "你刚才在唱歌？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28571002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "是、是的……如果有打扰到你，真的很抱歉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28571005",
              "text": "不会，旋律非常好听。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28571004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "是「团子大家族」的歌哦，我最喜欢「团子大家族」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "可惜成为「手办」后，知道「团子大家族」的人越来越少了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28571008",
              "text": "不要难过，这个送给你。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28571007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "好、好多团子……顽皮的烧烤团子……温柔的豆沙团子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "我一直憧憬着的「团子大家族」，就是现在这个样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是我亲手做的团子屋，你能喜欢真是太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "我很喜欢……非常喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28571012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "辛苦你了。有你在，我感觉更有勇气了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
